<%- include("layouts/headers") %>

<div class="container py-3">
  <h1>Welcome to Briz example</h1>
  <p>You can choose the example below, and notice how the page changes without reloading.</p>
  
  <ol class="list-group-numbered">
    <li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start">
      <div class="ms-2 me-auto">
        <div class="fw-bold">
          <a data-nav data-no-prefetch href="/swap">Basic Swap</a>
        </div>
        This is the most fundamental feature. It shows how to change the contents of a div element without refreshing the page.
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start">
      <div class="ms-2 me-auto">
        <div class="fw-bold">
          <a data-nav href="/polling">Auto Polling</a>
        </div>
        Shows elements that can update themselves automatically.
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start">
      <div class="ms-2 me-auto">
        <div class="fw-bold">
          <a data-nav href="/event">Inject headers for request</a>
        </div>
        Intercept requests and add headers before the request begins. Applies to all requests.
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start">
      <div class="ms-2 me-auto">
        <div class="fw-bold">
          <a data-nav href="/sse">Realtime using SSE</a>
        </div>
        Real time one-way data updates from server to client using SSE.
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start">
      <div class="ms-2 me-auto">
        <div class="fw-bold">
          <a data-nav href="/loading">Shows a loading spinner during request</a>
        </div>
        Make UX good with loading action for a request.
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start">
      <div class="ms-2 me-auto">
        <div class="fw-bold">
          <a data-nav href="/multi_swap">Update many element in the DOM</a>
        </div>
        Swap multiple elements at once in a single server response.
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start">
      <div class="ms-2 me-auto">
        <div class="fw-bold">
          <a data-nav href="/redirect">Redirect</a>
        </div>
        Perform automatic server side redirect when its needed
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start">
      <div class="ms-2 me-auto">
        <div class="fw-bold">
          <a data-nav href="/transition">Transition</a>
        </div>
        Add transition animation for partial swap action.
      </div>
    </li>
  </ol>
</div>

<%- include("layouts/footers") %>
